              passed in _i_n_i_t_r_d___f_d is ignored.

       The kkeexxeecc__ffiillee__llooaadd() system call was added to provide support for sys‐
       tems  where  "kexec"  loading should be restricted to only kernels that
       are signed.  This system call is available only if the kernel was  con‐
       figured with CCOONNFFIIGG__KKEEXXEECC__FFIILLEE.

